        {
          "title": "Blue Force Tracking",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>The key ATAK feature is automatic Blue Force Tracking.</li>\n<li>ATAK automatically reports locations to server.</li>\n<li>With this feature, you'll see where your team members are.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/e0c950f756a2ca75.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Set your location manually",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>If you don't have GPS, you can set your location manually.</li>\n<li>To do so, long tap the <strong>\"NO GPS\"</strong> text.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/5d03f66cc09c3221.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Move your marker",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Drag your marker to set your location.</li>\n<li>Your location is now shown to you and others.</li>\n<li>It will stay here until you move it or you remove your manual location setup.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/c12b2758017026a4.webp",
              "width": 2340,
              "height": 1080
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
